    shortTitle: 'In-company BHV',
    tagline: 'Train your emergency response team in your own building using your own escape routes',
    price: 'from € 125,00',
    duration: '1 day or half-day at your site',
    target:
      'For international companies, offices, schools, warehouses and healthcare facilities with 6+ participants seeking tailored Dutch or English BHV certification without travel time.',
    suitableForHtml: [
      'From <strong>6 participants</strong>, an In-company BHV training at your own premises is almost always more cost-effective and impactful than individual open-enrollment bookings.',
      'Your Dutch- and English-speaking employees practice directly with your own AED, fire panel, escape routes, assembly point and site-specific RI&amp;E risks.',
